  "intent": "The sheet scrolls under a frozen column. Light: the scrolling column is flicked left toward the frozen boundary, trailing two speed lines, slows against it like a rubber band and snaps back quickly, overshooting a little before it settles. Strong: the column is pulled right first, then flicked further left with the speed lines, snaps back past rest and settles with one more small swing. The frozen column and the divider never move.",
